Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.48,0:00:18.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,该你走了 小姑娘\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your move, pumpkin.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.40,0:00:21.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在思考\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm thinking.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.54,0:00:37.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,米奇 拿着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mitch, grab that.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.76,0:00:47.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,上去吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go on.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.27,0:01:05.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不能一直思考\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't think forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.00,0:01:09.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,迟早得出手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sooner or later, you've got to make a move.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.29,0:01:12.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,反正你也从不让我赢\N{\fnArial\fs30}You never let me win anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.94,0:01:15.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,让了就不算赢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, that wouldn't be winning.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.83,0:01:19.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我爸爸以前常这么说\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what my daddy used to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.20,0:01:25.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,他也经常下棋赢我\N{\fnArial\fs30}He used to beat me at chess, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.45,0:01:31.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,他什么都比我好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Heck, he used to beat me at everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.15,0:01:50.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,你认识这个人吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know this guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.85,0:01:54.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你爸爸刻薄吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Was your dad mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.65,0:01:56.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,有时候吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sometimes.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.97,0:01:59.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,你坏吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Were you bad?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.99,0:02:03.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,有时候吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sometimes.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.60,0:02:14.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,你一直在路上漂泊吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you've been on the road all this time?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.79,0:02:18.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.39,0:02:21.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没事吧 布莱恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}You okay, Brian?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.48,0:02:42.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了 小姑娘\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is it, pumpkin?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.20,0:02:46.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我坏吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Am I bad?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.03,0:02:50.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.97,0:02:56.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为什么会这样想\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why would you think that?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.74,0:03:00.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我爸爸总是对我很刻薄\N{\fnArial\fs30}My dad was always mean to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.58,0:03:04.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,你很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, you're good.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.26,0:03:06.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.67,0:03:09.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的营地离这里半英里\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've got a camp about a half a mile from here.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.07,0:03:11.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,绝对不行 马丁内斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hell, no, Martinez.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.11,0:03:14.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们那边人已经够多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got too many mouths as it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.07,0:03:15.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,看在老天的份上 他们带着个小孩\N{\fnArial\fs30}They got a kid for Christ's sake.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.26,0:03:16.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你跟我们回去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, if you do come back with us,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.89,0:03:18.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,就得接受两件事\N{\fnArial\fs30}there's two things you got to accept.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.68,0:03:20.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,第一 我掌权\N{\fnArial\fs30}One, I'm in charge.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.91,0:03:23.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,第二 不许成为累赘\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two, no deadweight.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.09,0:03:25.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家都得遵守\N{\fnArial\fs30}That goes for everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.32,0:03:31.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,要么做出贡献 要么就被赶走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Contribute or be cast out.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.56,0:03:35.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能接受吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you live with that,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.26,0:03:38.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,布莱恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Brian?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.07,0:03:43.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,你我 你妈妈 还有塔拉姨妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}You, me, your mom, and Aunt Tara,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.57,0:03:44.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们都会没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}we're gonna be okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.61,0:03:46.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我们是好人吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}'Cause we're good?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.96,0:03:49.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们都是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}All of us?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.19,0:04:17.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,该你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.85,0:04:21.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,布莱恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Brian?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.71,0:04:25.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,该你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's your turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.59,0:04:32.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在思考\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm thinking.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.11,0:05:35.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,你今天出去吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You going out there today?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.72,0:05:38.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,去找补给品\N{\fnArial\fs30}Supply run.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.05,0:05:41.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,马丁内斯和杜尔根兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Martinez and the Dolgen brothers.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.73,0:05:56.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要在营地建立一个护士站\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna set up a nurses' station for the camp.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.35,0:05:57.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们有这个需要\N{\fnArial\fs30}They need one.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.70,0:06:02.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 抱歉 莉莉 这地方… - 别说了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm sorry, Lily. This place is… - Stop it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.99,0:06:05.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想为我们找到更好的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wanted something better for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.95,0:06:07.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个营地不错了\N{\fnArial\fs30}This camp is good.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.77,0:06:10.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会让这里变得更好\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll make it better.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.92,0:06:28.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,有鱼吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}How's the fishing?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.57,0:06:31.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,没鱼了 池塘水质不好\N{\fnArial\fs30}There isn't any. Pond's dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.50,0:06:35.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是一潭死水\N{\fnArial\fs30}As a doornail.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.33,0:06:38.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我们还可以抓点兔子 臭鼬\N{\fnArial\fs30}We still got rabbits, skunks,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.60,0:06:40.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,负鼠什么的来吃\N{\fnArial\fs30}some possum out here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.12,0:06:43.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还是管好你自己吧 独眼老布\N{\fnArial\fs30}You better watch your ass, One Eye Bri.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.11,0:06:57.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你确定我们走对方向了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You sure we're headed in the right direction?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.23,0:06:58.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,照着霍华德的地图走的\N{\fnArial\fs30}If Howard's map is right.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.03,0:07:01.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,真应该把他拖出来问个清楚\N{\fnArial\fs30}We should have dragged his ass out here to make sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.41,0:07:03.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,人家老年人 哪里走得动\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's an old man. He can barely walk.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.35,0:07:04.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我才说拖着他走\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's why I said dragged.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.68,0:07:07.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,希望这趟没白跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hope this is worth it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.14,0:07:09.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许他是那种末日生存主义者\N{\fnArial\fs30}Supposedly this guy was a survivalist type.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.82,0:07:11.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的小屋里或许能找出有用的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}His cabin might have stuff we can use.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.71,0:07:13.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,说不定他还活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hell, maybe he's still alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.53,0:07:15.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得危险\N{\fnArial\fs30}I won't keep my fingers crossed.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.17,0:07:22.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 独眼龙 你在干嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, One Eye. What you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.90,0:07:52.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}The hell is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.90,0:07:53.63,Note,0,0,0,0,,（骗子）
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.63,0:07:55.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来他把某人惹毛了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Somebody pissed somebody off.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.35,0:07:58.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,管他呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who gives a shit?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.44,0:08:01.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,死了一了百了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That guy's got nothing to worry about anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.74,0:08:03.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,继续走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.27,0:08:08.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这个伤口很深 - 没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's a deep cut. - No, that's nothing, ma'am.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.19,0:08:10.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过是玩刀子玩过头了 很快就好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just got cute with my knife, that's all. I'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.30,0:08:15.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么…\N{\fnArial\fs30}So…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.62,0:08:17.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我叫艾丽西娅\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alicia.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.02,0:08:19.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦对 艾丽西娅\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alicia. Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.21,0:08:22.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是海军陆战队的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You in the Marines or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.07,0:08:25.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是陆军预备役\N{\fnArial\fs30}Army. In the reserves.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.25,0:08:27.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,用的M4步枪对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}An M4, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.11,0:08:33.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有意见吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't approve?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.26,0:08:35.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,别误会\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, don't get me wrong,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.69,0:08:38.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,用M4步枪打近战不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}an M4 is great for close combat,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.50,0:08:40.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,但作为野战武器的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}but as a field weapon?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.50,0:08:43.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,尘土飞扬易卡壳 还是算了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}With all that dirt and dust, no, thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.05,0:08:48.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不太喜欢长枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've never really been into big guns anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.43,0:08:50.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我更喜欢史密斯威森手枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm more of a Smith & Wesson gal.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.70,0:08:52.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,方便又好用\N{\fnArial\fs30}Less fuss, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.96,0:08:55.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你尽喜欢装逼对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You always this full of shit?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.13,0:08:59.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.99,0:09:33.88,Note,0,0,0,0,,（强奸犯）
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.16,0:10:10.07,Note,0,0,0,0,,（凶手）
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.07,0:10:11.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,自杀了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Took himself out.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.56,0:10:14.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得是他杀了那些军人吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think he's the one who 86'd those military guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.96,0:10:18.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他的头还在 - 没剩多少了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- He still has his head. - Some of it, anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.72,0:10:28.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,进屋看看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's see what he's got inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.81,0:10:48.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,听到了吗 里面有行尸\N{\fnArial\fs30}You hear that? There's one in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.17,0:10:51.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,肯定被卡住了出不来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Must be stuck if it ain't coming out.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.68,0:10:52.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,要进去吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}We going in?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.31,0:10:55.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,你吓尿了吗 磨蹭什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want us to wait till you finish pissing in your pants?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.55,0:10:56.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不 我只是 - 别废话了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No, I'm… - Cut the chatter.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.37,0:11:02.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,进去吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.45,0:11:59.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 很近了 - 安静\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's close. - Quiet.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.30,0:12:37.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 它出来了 - 闭嘴\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's out. - Shut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.17,0:12:39.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,赶走它\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get it off of me!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.89,0:12:41.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,把它弄下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get it off of me! Get it off of me!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.13,0:12:43.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,快把它弄下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get it off of me!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.75,0:13:03.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,皮特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pete!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.04,0:13:40.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,假如当时坑里只有你一人\N{\fnArial\fs30}If it was just you in that pit,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.52,0:13:44.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是不会把你带进营地的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wouldn't have brought you into the camp.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.34,0:13:47.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,要不是那些和你在一起的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}If it weren't for the people you were with…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.80,0:13:50.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个小女孩儿…\N{\fnArial\fs30}the girl…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.84,0:14:02.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,你感觉不太一样了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You seem different now.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.34,0:14:04.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,变了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.07,0:14:06.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,是不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.03,0:14:12.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.84,0:14:17.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.36,0:14:22.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,这人有堆好东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}The guy had some good stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.40,0:14:26.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,罐头\N{\fnArial\fs30}Canned food.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.68,0:14:32.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们有啤酒喝了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got beer.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.64,0:14:52.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,天呐 这儿发生什么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Man, what happened here?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.03,0:14:55.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,这间小屋里到底发生了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, what the hell was going on in this cabin?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.46,0:14:58.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,他养着那些行尸吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Was he storing those biters?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.10,0:14:59.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,她们是他的妻子和小孩\N{\fnArial\fs30}They were his wife and kid, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.24,0:15:02.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 它们是行尸\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, they were biters.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.28,0:15:04.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些头又是怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about those heads?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.45,0:15:09.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些头的主人惹错了对象\N{\fnArial\fs30}Belonged to the guys who did the wrong thing to the wrong man.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.04,0:15:11.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们还是别细想这事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Probably best not to think too much about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.93,0:15:14.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你最好听独眼老布的话 皮特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Better listen to One Eye Bri, Pete.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.73,0:15:20.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我永远也分不清他是在使眼色还是在眨眼\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can never tell if he's winking or blinking.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.91,0:15:26.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你知道如何控制的 是吧 老布\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you know how to regulate, don't you, Bri?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.86,0:15:31.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,他一直是这样吗 马丁内斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was always like this, Martinez?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.31,0:15:35.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 喜怒不形于色\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yeah. Ice in the veins.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.31,0:15:37.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你应该看看他当年风光的样子\N{\fnArial\fs30}You should have seen him back in the day.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.83,0:15:38.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们大伙儿呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about you fellas, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.83,0:15:41.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,在这巨变发生前你是做什么的\N{\fnArial\fs30}What did you do before it all changed?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.33,0:15:42.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.42,0:15:45.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是个冰淇淋车司机\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was an ice cream truck driver.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.04,0:15:49.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,之后我鸟枪换炮\N{\fnArial\fs30}Till I upgraded my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.81,0:15:51.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,成为了一个坦克驾驶员\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I became a tank operator.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.23,0:15:53.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,为美国陆军服务\N{\fnArial\fs30}for the US Army.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.36,0:15:59.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,当一切变糟之后\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then when everything went tits up,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.71,0:16:02.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我离开了军队 开走了坦克\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got the hell out and took my ride with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.57,0:16:05.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,假如你有一辆坦克的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}End of the world don't mean shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.28,0:16:07.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,世界末日就不算什么屁事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}when you got a tank.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.57,0:16:11.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也是陆军\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was Army, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.47,0:16:14.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,驻扎在本宁堡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stationed out of Fort Benning.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.45,0:16:17.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,灾难降临后我还在那待了一阵子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stayed for a while after it all started.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.15,0:16:19.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是我家皮特\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's my Pete.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.27,0:16:21.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,他太忠心了 不愿离开\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's too loyal to bounce.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.13,0:16:26.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,你呢 布莱恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about you, Brian?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.39,0:16:28.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,当时你在做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What did you do when it all went bad?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.41,0:16:32.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,生存\N{\fnArial\fs30}I survived.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.17,0:16:47.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 你父亲是天主教神父\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, your father was a Catholic priest?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.95,0:16:48.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.76,0:16:50.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以神父当了爹吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So the father became a daddy?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.95,0:16:53.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,的确给教堂带来了一些麻烦\N{\fnArial\fs30}It caused some problems with the Church a little bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.02,0:16:56.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些故事布莱恩以前都听过\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is all stuff Brian's heard before.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.63,0:16:57.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在一起待过很长时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}We spent a lot of time out there together.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.92,0:17:01.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们在这里做得很好 我是说这个营地\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've done all right here. I mean this camp.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.40,0:17:03.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是一切发生之后我第一次有安全感\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the first time I've felt safe since all this started.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.99,0:17:06.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我跟布莱恩之前待的地方挺不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}The place Brian and I lived before kind of worked.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.49,0:17:07.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想让这里也一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess I wanted that again.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.60,0:17:09.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,听起来你们的旧营地非常好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sounds like your old camp was pretty sweet.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.81,0:17:11.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们有围墙 对吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You guys had walls, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.00,0:17:14.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 那是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Yeah, it was…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.59,0:17:16.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是个好地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}it was a good place.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.09,0:17:20.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里也是个好地方 对吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}This place is good, too, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.30,0:17:22.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.74,0:17:25.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,希望有一天我能听听详情\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want to hear all about it someday.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.47,0:17:26.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,布莱恩一个字都不肯说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Brian won't say a word.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.94,0:17:29.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,过去的事就让它过去吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I say leave the past in the past.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.26,0:17:33.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 很久以来第一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, for the first time in a long time,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.91,0:17:35.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我醉成一坨屎了 - 塔拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm shitfaced. - Tara.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.59,0:17:38.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 梅根 别说那个词 好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry. Megan, don't say that, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.15,0:17:40.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你想走了吗 - 好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You want to get out of here? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.33,0:17:43.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢款待 尤其谢谢你们的啤酒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks for the dinner. Double thanks for the suds.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.83,0:17:45.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 再见\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Boom. There you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.48,0:17:50.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 注意安全 - 好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Be safe. - Yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.15,0:17:54.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想我也该走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think, um… I think I'm gonna go.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.42,0:17:57.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你确定吗 我还有不少臭啤酒呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}You sure? I got a couple of skunky beers left.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.83,0:18:05.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没事 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm good, thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.17,0:18:08.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,布莱恩 屋顶又漏了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Brian, the roof's leaking again.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.56,0:18:11.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你去修修吧 伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}You should fix that, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.87,0:18:13.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.67,0:18:17.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,回见 小娃娃\N{\fnArial\fs30}Later, muneca.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.44,0:18:43.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,差点忘了 有个惊喜给你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Almost forgot. Got a surprise for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.50,0:18:57.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我靠\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aw, damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.46,0:18:59.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,再给我递一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hand me another one.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.12,0:19:06.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道他死了 对吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know he's dead, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.15,0:19:08.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,香珀特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shumpert?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.03,0:19:12.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,伍德伯里之后他就不一样了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was never the same after Woodbury.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.77,0:19:18.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,他变得不顾死活\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. He got reckless.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.45,0:19:23.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,行尸在那边咬掉了他一块肉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Biter took a piece of him right over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.53,0:19:26.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我发誓 他都没想要躲开\N{\fnArial\fs30}I swear, he didn't try to get out of the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.04,0:19:29.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我亲手杀了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I put him down myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.10,0:19:31.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,就在那边\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.32,0:19:34.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.88,0:19:38.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,有些事情你永远无法回头\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's some things you just can't come back from.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.97,0:19:40.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们变成了你的一部分\N{\fnArial\fs30}They become a part of who you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.63,0:19:42.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管你是否能够接受\N{\fnArial\fs30}Either you live with them or you don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.24,0:19:45.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,看起来你接受的挺好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you seem to be living with them pretty well.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.09,0:19:48.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}So are you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.42,0:19:53.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,那家人真是让你变了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That family, they brought you back.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.49,0:19:57.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你很幸运 我不能\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're lucky. I couldn't…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.46,0:20:00.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不能再那么做了 不能冒那个险\N{\fnArial\fs30}I couldn't do that again. Couldn't risk it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.65,0:20:03.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,想到可能失去她们 我就无法安眠\N{\fnArial\fs30}Couldn't sleep at night knowing I was gonna lose them.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.12,0:20:04.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会失去她们的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not gonna lose them.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.36,0:20:06.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.25,0:20:13.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不认为你能保护营地的安全吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What, you don't think you can keep this place safe?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.40,0:20:15.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会尽力\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll try.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.11,0:20:19.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,希望我们能尽量做好准备\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hopefully we'll be prepared for whatever comes.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.36,0:20:22.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在你来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now you're here,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.23,0:20:25.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许我们可以分享权力\N{\fnArial\fs30}maybe we can share the crown a little.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.55,0:20:30.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,天呐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, Jesus.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.20,0:20:33.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,早知道我就学学高尔夫了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I should have taken some golf lessons before the-
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.36,0:21:20.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不想这么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't wanna do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.14,0:21:28.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不想 我不想\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't want it! I don't want it!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.89,0:21:33.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,听见了吗 我也不想 该死的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You hear me? I don't want it, damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.94,0:21:43.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不想这么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't want it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.23,0:21:47.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不想这么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't want it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.85,0:22:07.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,布莱恩 我们回来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Brian, we're home!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.63,0:22:09.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,梅根 他睡觉呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Megan, he's sleeping.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.07,0:22:13.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,布莱恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Brian?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.12,0:22:16.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在发抖\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're shaking.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.92,0:22:22.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.71,0:22:27.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,做了个噩梦 没什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just had a bad dream, that's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.16,0:22:37.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么样的噩梦\N{\fnArial\fs30}What was it?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.34,0:22:40.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不记得了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't remember.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.85,0:22:45.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家听着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen up!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.60,0:22:49.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天早上 我们在坑里\N{\fnArial\fs30}We found what was left of Martinez.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.71,0:22:51.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,找到了马丁内斯的残骸\N{\fnArial\fs30}in a pit this morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.61,0:22:56.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,貌似他当时在打高尔夫\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looks like he was hitting some golf balls,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.30,0:22:57.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,他喝多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}he got drunk,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.88,0:23:00.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后掉进了坑里\N{\fnArial\fs30}he fell in.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.07,0:23:05.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,那现在怎么办\N{\fnArial\fs30}So now what?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.81,0:23:08.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我将接管营地\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm taking leadership of the camp.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.22,0:23:11.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不 不 - 等一下 都等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No. No. - Hold on now. Hold on now!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.33,0:23:13.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们应该投票才对\N{\fnArial\fs30}We should vote on who leads, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.52,0:23:16.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是啊 - 你没权利就这么接任\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah. - You can't just take over.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.28,0:23:18.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 闭嘴 婊子 - 你说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Shut your mouth, you little bitch. - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.34,0:23:21.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,冷静\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, calm down!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.04,0:23:22.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家都冷静\N{\fnArial\fs30}Calm down, all of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.97,0:23:28.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们现在\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.85,0:23:30.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,更需要团结一致\N{\fnArial\fs30}now more than ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.63,0:23:33.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,能熬过这一切的唯一办法\N{\fnArial\fs30}The only way we get through this, through any of this,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.08,0:23:34.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是团结一致\N{\fnArial\fs30}is together.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.71,0:23:38.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在的安排是暂时的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now this is temporary.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.50,0:23:40.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,未来几天内我们会想办法选举\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll find some kind of way to do a vote in the next couple of days.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.95,0:23:43.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,但现在 一切照旧\N{\fnArial\fs30}For now, it's business as usual.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.27,0:23:44.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,行吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.90,0:23:53.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们听见他说的了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You heard the man.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.59,0:23:56.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,解散\N{\fnArial\fs30}Move!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.71,0:24:01.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.05,0:24:06.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,做好准备 我们去找补给\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gear up. We're going on a hunt.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.99,0:24:13.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,定量配给 修护栏 药品储备\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rationing, fences, medical supplies.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.31,0:24:17.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,有无数个问题而人们期望我给出答案\N{\fnArial\fs30}There are 100 questions and people are looking to me for answers.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.10,0:24:20.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,当领袖是很难\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, it's hard to lead.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.55,0:24:22.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 我需要点协助\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I could use some help.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.86,0:24:48.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,有多少人\N{\fnArial\fs30}How many?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.10,0:24:50.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,10个\N{\fnArial\fs30}10.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.20,0:24:52.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能不到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe less.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.14,0:24:56.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,但他们供给很足\N{\fnArial\fs30}They got a lot of supplies, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.78,0:24:59.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许我们该把他们吸收进来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe we should take 'em in.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.12,0:25:01.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你疯了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you crazy?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.75,0:25:04.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的供给只是勉强够分\N{\fnArial\fs30}We barely got enough to go around as it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.64,0:25:09.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 皮特 我知道你不想伤害任何人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, Pete, I know you don't want to hurt nobody.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.27,0:25:11.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也不想 但我们需要那些供给\N{\fnArial\fs30}Neither do I, but we need those supplies.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.96,0:25:13.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们直接过去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now let's just go over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.04,0:25:16.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿到需要的东西 就回家\N{\fnArial\fs30}and take what we need and go home.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.27,0:25:17.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,不采取暴力\N{\fnArial\fs30}No rough stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.15,0:25:19.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你想抢劫他们 - 何不呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You want to rob 'em? - Why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.25,0:25:20.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们需要他们的补给\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need their stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.69,0:25:26.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他们有枪 但如果我们动作快点 - 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}- They got guns, but if we roll up on 'em quick… - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.41,0:25:31.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,不行 我们自己也能找到供给\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, we can find our own supplies.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.00,0:25:32.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.75,0:25:55.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,太搞笑了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What a joke.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.26,0:25:56.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们干得挺好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We did all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.44,0:25:59.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 几只该死的松鼠 几罐炼乳\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, a couple of damn squirrels, some condensed milk.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.54,0:26:01.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还要我怎么样 我在努力呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you want from me? I'm trying here.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.16,0:26:11.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,你去哪儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where you going?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.06,0:26:34.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,狗娘养的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Son of a bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.69,0:26:37.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,狗娘养的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Son of a bitch!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.29,0:26:41.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不是行尸干的\N{\fnArial\fs30}This wasn't biters.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.69,0:26:43.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,是人干的\N{\fnArial\fs30}People did this.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.21,0:26:44.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,肯定是刚发生的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Must have just happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.94,0:26:46.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们本来可以拿到供给的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We would have had those supplies.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.88,0:26:47.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,死了这么多人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're worried about supplies?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.00,0:26:49.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还在担心供给 米奇\N{\fnArial\fs30}These people are dead, Mitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.05,0:26:51.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说的太对了 他们死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're damn right they're dead!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.45,0:26:53.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,反正他们都是个死\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was gonna happen either way.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.35,0:26:55.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在倒让别人抢走了咱们的供给\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now some other group's got our stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:04.70,0:27:07.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,米奇 米奇 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mitch. Mitch, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.51,0:27:22.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,他可能还活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}He might have lived.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.67,0:27:25.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Might have.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.59,0:27:48.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,需要这个吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Need this?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.16,0:27:56.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,布莱恩 出什么事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Brian, what's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.63,0:27:58.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 马上收拾你的东西 - 怎么啦\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Pack your things, now. - What's happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.55,0:28:00.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 宝贝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold on, baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.13,0:28:04.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿上你的衣服 带点吃的 快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Grab your clothes, pack some food. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.46,0:28:06.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mommy?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.38,0:28:08.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 布莱恩 住手 - 去找塔拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Brian, stop. - Get Tara.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.78,0:28:11.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得走了 这里不再安全了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need to leave. It isn't safe here anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.20,0:28:13.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在说什么呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.61,0:28:16.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不能就这么走人\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can't just run off.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.20,0:28:17.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是营地里唯一的护士\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm the only nurse in camp.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.43,0:28:19.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,塔拉跟艾丽西娅在一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tara's got Alicia.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.52,0:28:20.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,那梅根怎么办\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about Megan?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.12,0:28:23.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 这里就要出大事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, things are about to go very wrong here.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.48,0:28:26.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以前遇到过 不能再让你和梅根遭罪\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's happened to me before. I can't put you and Megan through that.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.53,0:28:28.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,不能再失去你们了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can't lose you again.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.32,0:28:31.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,那皮特怎么办\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about Pete?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.23,0:28:33.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说过他是个好人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You said he was a good man.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.49,0:28:35.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我错了 - 但是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Well, I was wrong. - But…
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.54,0:28:37.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,你相信我吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you trust me?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.82,0:28:40.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,你相信我吗 莉莉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you trust me, Lily?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.83,0:28:45.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就快收拾东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then pack your things.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.19,0:28:48.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们今晚就走\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're leaving tonight, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.39,0:28:49.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.52,0:28:51.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mommy.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.23,0:28:54.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mommy.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.92,0:28:58.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要去哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are we going?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.81,0:29:00.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 艾丽西娅 - 你应该开慢点\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Alicia. - Maybe you should slow down.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.99,0:29:03.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,不行 我不明白 我不懂\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I don't understand this. I don't understand this.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.24,0:29:05.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管去哪里我们都在一起 好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, we're together, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.09,0:29:08.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,营地里什么都有 有食物有住所\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have everything back there. We have food, we have shelter.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.49,0:29:15.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 布莱恩 - 天呐\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Brian. - Oh, my god.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.52,0:29:17.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,待在车里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just stay in the car.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:50.56,0:30:51.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.59,0:30:58.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,生存\N{\fnArial\fs30}Surviving.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.52,0:31:25.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们需要谈谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need to talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.92,0:31:27.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,米奇的事情\N{\fnArial\fs30}About Mitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.15,0:31:30.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,进来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come in.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:32.98,0:31:34.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就知道会这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}I knew this was coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:34.22,0:31:36.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我总是得帮他擦屁股\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been getting him out of trouble my…
Dialogue: 0,0:32:29.43,0:32:30.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,皮特呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's Pete?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:34.46,0:32:35.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,他死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:38.34,0:32:40.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在你也要把我干掉吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You gonna kill me, too, now?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:41.95,0:32:45.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我杀了营地里那个老家伙吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Huh? For the old guy at the camp?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:58.72,0:32:59.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,抽烟吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Smoke?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:03.21,0:33:04.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,你对我哥哥做了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why did you do my brother?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:04.95,0:33:06.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,关于那个营地 你说的对\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were right about that camp.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:06.16,0:33:08.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们应该抢走他们的补给\N{\fnArial\fs30}We should have taken their supplies.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:08.74,0:33:11.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不在乎你杀了那个老头\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't care that you killed the old man.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:11.82,0:33:14.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,像你哥哥那种人 总是坚持做对的事情\N{\fnArial\fs30}Men like your brother, always doing the right thing,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:15.68,0:33:18.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,甚至以自己人为代价\N{\fnArial\fs30}even at the cost of their own people.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:21.22,0:33:23.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,抽根烟吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go on. Have a cigarette.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:23.87,0:33:25.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我戒了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I quit.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:27.02,0:33:28.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, me, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:30.43,0:33:32.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还记得我抽的第一根烟\N{\fnArial\fs30}I remember the first smoke I ever had.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:32.22,0:33:34.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我和我哥挤在车库里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Me and my brother huddled in the garage.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:34.54,0:33:37.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,吸着我爸的好彩烟\N{\fnArial\fs30}puffing on one of my dad's lucky strikes.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:37.69,0:33:40.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,他肯定是闻到了烟味 接着就冲了进来\N{\fnArial\fs30}He must have smelled the smoke, because he came barging in,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:40.10,0:33:42.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,想揍我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}looking to beat up on us.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:42.58,0:33:44.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是我哥哥挡在我前面\N{\fnArial\fs30}But my brother got between us.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.36,0:33:48.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,说是他偷的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Said he stole them.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:49.49,0:33:51.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,根本不是 是我偷的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wasn't true. It was me.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:53.02,0:33:54.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我哥哥就是那种人\N{\fnArial\fs30}But that was my brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:58.16,0:33:59.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,英雄\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hero.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:02.79,0:34:05.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,他因此被揍得鼻青脸肿 肋骨断了一根\N{\fnArial\fs30}He got two black eyes and a broken rib for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:05.91,0:34:07.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我还是挨了打\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I got beat anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:11.13,0:34:12.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿一根吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take one.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:35.55,0:34:36.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在我接管了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm running things now,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:36.94,0:34:41.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会尽我所能保护这个营地\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I will do everything it takes to protect this camp.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:42.50,0:34:44.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你加入我 我保证\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, if you join me, I promise you.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:44.98,0:34:46.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,你再也不用担心自己的行为\N{\fnArial\fs30}you will never have to worry about whether you were doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:46.84,0:34:49.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,是对还是错\N{\fnArial\fs30}the right thing or the wrong thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:49.20,0:34:51.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为为了营地\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because we will do.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:52.70,0:34:54.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会做任何事\N{\fnArial\fs30}the only thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:19.08,0:35:22.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们怎么对营地的人说皮特的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are we gonna tell the camp about Pete?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:24.35,0:35:27.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,就说他在寻找补给时\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll tell them he died on a supply run.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:27.95,0:35:29.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,为救我们而死\N{\fnArial\fs30}saving our asses.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:35.51,0:35:38.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得人们会相信吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think they're really gonna believe that?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:38.53,0:35:41.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,人们相信自己想相信的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}People believe what they want to believe.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:45.12,0:35:47.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,人人都爱英雄\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everybody loves a hero.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:02.94,0:36:04.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,外围防护如何了\N{\fnArial\fs30}How's the perimeter coming?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:04.59,0:36:07.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,快好了 我们用车围起了整个营地\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's good. We got cars ringing almost the entire camp.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:07.14,0:36:08.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,再去找点东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think a few more runs,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:08.25,0:36:09.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,就能建起一个缓冲带了\N{\fnArial\fs30}we should have ourselves a nice little buffer.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:09.77,0:36:10.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,坑里呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the pits?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:10.90,0:36:12.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,行尸不断来 我们不断烧\N{\fnArial\fs30}They keep coming, we keep burning them.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:12.92,0:36:14.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,不知道是不是因为太热了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know if it's the heat or what,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:14.20,0:36:16.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,最近它们变得非常多\N{\fnArial\fs30}but there have been a hell of a lot more of them lately.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:16.19,0:36:17.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 弹药呢 - 充足\N{\fnArial\fs30}- And the armory? - solid.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:17.86,0:36:20.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我收集了营地的所有子弹\N{\fnArial\fs30}I rounded up all the ammo in camp.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:20.00,0:36:22.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的子弹都堆满了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're officially stocked in the bullet department.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:22.05,0:36:23.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,但还是告诉你的队员\N{\fnArial\fs30}Still, tell your crews.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:23.93,0:36:26.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,以后外出搜索只准用弓箭\N{\fnArial\fs30}supply runs are arrow only from now on.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:26.53,0:36:28.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,子弹这年头很珍贵\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gunshots are a luxury.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:28.25,0:36:29.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,留着它们迟早用的上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sooner or later we're gonna need 'em.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:29.76,0:36:33.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 不只是对付行尸\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's right, and not just for the biters.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:33.46,0:36:35.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,米奇 我 还有皮特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mitch and I and Pete,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:35.29,0:36:37.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们见识过外面的人有多危险\N{\fnArial\fs30}we saw what people can do out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:37.41,0:36:40.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果碰到陌生人 就避开他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}You come across strangers, you just avoid them.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:40.43,0:36:42.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,回来告诉我们你在哪里看到了他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come back here and tell us where you saw them, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:42.63,0:36:43.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,解散\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:02.63,0:37:05.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许我们能找到更好的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe we can find a better place.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:10.92,0:37:12.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道 如果\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, if…
Dialogue: 0,0:37:14.15,0:37:16.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们愿意去争取的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}we're willing to fight for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:17.63,0:37:20.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不用去找更好的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't need to find a better place.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:25.05,0:37:26.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里就是家\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is home.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:37.77,0:37:38.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是鬼 塔拉姨妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're it, Aunt Tara.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:38.94,0:37:41.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么 我不能当鬼 我在放哨\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? I can't be it. I'm on guard duty.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:41.21,0:37:43.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是个负责任的成年人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have to be a responsible adult.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:44.17,0:37:45.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你是鬼 - 快去追她\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You're it. - Go get her.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:45.84,0:37:47.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这不公平 - 快跑 梅根\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No fair! - Run, Megan.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:24.02,0:38:26.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不必独自承担\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't have to do this alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:34.66,0:38:36.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,抓到你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Caught you.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:44.53,0:38:46.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,塔拉姨妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aunt Tara!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:47.91,0:38:49.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,梅根\N{\fnArial\fs30}Megan!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:49.54,0:38:52.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,塔拉姨妈 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aunt Tara! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:05.55,0:39:07.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 妈妈 - 梅根\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Mommy! - Megan!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:17.93,0:39:20.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事了 没事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's okay. It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:20.15,0:39:21.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's okay.
